# Day 17

**26km / 7 hours**

I really struggle to have much to say that's distinct about the day, there was plenty of road walking, similar to previous days. There was a little section in the forest that had two river crossings that resulted in my feet being wet which was non-ideal.

![The river that I had to walk through. Not super tricky or anything but I did get wet](./river.jpg)

Apart from that limited part it was endless road. Dodging cars and crossing roads, that's my life for now.